      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>BB was trying to unlock the genetic code of Legacy so he could recreate it and use it on himself. While mostly a failure, seeing the success in Setback lead him to experiment&nbsp;on himself and become Jacked BB for Vengeance.</p><p>Legacy did not consent to this and had no knowledge&nbsp;of what was going on, So these power where effectively&nbsp;stolen from him by Baron Blade.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); font-family: Whitney, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(54, 57, 62);\">So I love the &quot;Ninja Avalanche&quot; line. NightMist is a Magical Hermit. And NightMist loses control of her powers. Yup liked the show, I am happy to hear more on NightMist, they even gave a good timeline to add my self-insert Character.<br /><br />We also have a better ida when Setback and Expat&#39;s promo incaps come from.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
